                当工资为 <span class="highlight-num">${salary}</span> 元时：<br>
                公式：(${salary} - 5000) × 3% = <span class="highlight-num" style="color:#ef4444;">${wrongResult} 元</span><br>
                <strong style="color:#b91c1c;">逻辑漏洞：</strong> 算出了负数税款！在数学公式中，减法可能产生负数，但现实中纳税额最低为 0。
            `;

            correctCalcText.innerHTML = `
                起征点是<strong>纳税的门槛</strong>。<br>
                • 当前工资 <span class="highlight-num">${salary}元</span> ≤ 起征点 5000元。<br>
                • 计税基数（应纳税所得额）直接归零，即 <span class="highlight-num">0 元</span>。<br>
                <strong>实际应纳税额：</strong> <span class="highlight-num" style="font-size: 18px; color:#15803d;">0 元</span>
            `;
        } else {
            // 闸门开启
            gateBar.setAttribute('transform', 'rotate(-60)');
            gateBar.setAttribute('stroke', '#10b981');
            gateStatus.textContent = '闸门开启 (超额纳税)';
            gateStatus.setAttribute('fill', '#10b981');

            // 显示超额橙色条
            const taxableWidth = xPos - xThreshold;
            taxableBar.setAttribute('width', taxableWidth);
            taxableBarText.setAttribute('display', 'block');
            taxableBarText.setAttribute('x', xThreshold + taxableWidth / 2);
            taxableBarText.textContent = `超出部分: ${salary - threshold}元`;

